    "speed_note": "speed_px_s = 0.9 unit/s x 400 px (대표 결정 2026-11-11, felt on the web test page). The clip's stride matches 0.42 unit/s (no_slide_px_s), so the feet glide a little at 0.9 - accepted.",
    "note": "speed in yard/garden canvas px at pet w=435. Screen-down/up movement is foreshortened by the 25 deg camera: ground distance = hypot(dx, dy / depth_factor); move so that ground distance grows by speed_px_s per second (pure horizontal = 360 px/s, pure vertical = 153 px/s). Clip: |dx| >= |dy / depth_factor| -> side (mirror when dx < 0), else dy > 0 -> front, dy < 0 -> back. Feet = same floor point as the garden clips (303, 697)."
  },
